      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Transfer vegetables to a blender. Add habanero peppers, tomato, water, lime juice, and vinegar; blend until smooth. Season with salt and pepper.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Transfer mixture to a saucepan and simmer over medium-low heat until a bit thicker, about 3 to 5 minutes.",
